; One variable: an unassigned code point (U+0378) that no font has, at the start of a line, at its end,
; in a wrapped line and beside Cyrillic, in Label, LineEdit, TextEdit, RichTextLabel and Button.
; Godot keeps its notdef glyph with no advance (text_server_adv.cpp:7060, :7106-7108), and the glyph
; rounds nothing into the carried remainder (gl.index != 0). DejaVu, Noto and the default font.
; No other scene holds an unassigned code point.

